---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: "Blog — {{ profile.name }}"
description: "Articles and writing by {{ profile.name }}."
---

<h1>Blog</h1>
<p class="page-lead">Selected writing on technology, product building, and systems thinking.</p>

{% if collections.articles | length > 0 %}
<div class="cards-grid">
  {% for article in collections.articles %}
    {% include "components/article-card.njk" %}
  {% endfor %}
</div>
{% else %}
<p class="empty-state">No articles published yet. Check back soon.</p>
{% endif %}
